Boys-Screenshots-04.png", "id": "1517338926148652", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308050_1517338929481985_7654362227711290593_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wy1ZyYUrkCwQ7kNvwG3DE8g&_nc_oc=AdoKPxWZx8Qi7Qt43jl69YLeW_wDCT4thcbGkd-3HCvbMz-dUQ2tXORVUfcJ14Ze7pI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5oqEXGscFdzqak9rLBSn_UK8ielOEyqtiszs6mkWArdQ&oe=6A05D7B5"}, {"file_name": "The-Boys-Screenshots-06.png", "id": "1176691953903036", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307931_1176691957236369_218406269715036273_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iyOoiM1TKysQ7kNvwFE2IZn&_nc_oc=Ado9_XUyqqJWPcUAWWARwPXCWuelmD2NaWZPiLO4CzWDM7N5A9vT54MH7hB5r4aNajw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7iEX2yyD9NmI2POU8mxXpNqYH120qINeTsG4K6thdQmw&oe=6A05F056"}, {"file_name": "The-Boys-Screenshots-05-B.png", "id": "2209073996249250", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307433_2209073999582583_5379605931758819862_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VeRP0KEDvuAQ7kNvwGtWnio&_nc_oc=AdqF_Ma061ryn2zmfw-JpkOocQJ7taQAkgAYmwtDDWXIEvcczjQw4GPQci4ooXaXHJU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4nrVdSwl9taezdSgxoCvTD8nm6EgNSGqE2Kq7U_9xQ_g&oe=6A05CE01"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The Boys", "keywords": ["superhero", "shooter", "rpg", "combat", "fight"], "long_description": "Developed with the creators of the hit TV series, **The Boys: Trigger Warning** throws you into the chaos with the original cast members returning to their iconic roles. Step back into the dark, unfiltered world you know and love, with a storyline set within the show\u2019s timeline, now personal and dangerously real.\n\n**PUBLIC SAFETY NOTICE FROM VOUGHT INTERNATIONAL**\n\nVought assures **The Boys: Trigger Warning** is an official, perfectly safe VR experience. Any rumors about \u201cextreme violence\u201d or \u201crogue Supes\u201d should be ignored.\n\nLucas, a loyal Vought employee, was enjoying Voughtland with his daughters when a group of washed-up D-list Supes, the Armstrongs, ruined everything. Now he\u2019s teamed up with The Boys, pumped full of unstable powers, striking from the shadows and aiming all that rage at Vought.\n\n**Become a Supe (Whether You Like It or Not)**\n\nUnstable powers. Bad decisions. Zero oversight.\n\n**Stealth or Chaos**\n\nPlan it out or blow it up. Both work; neither is safe.\n\n**Reach, Grab, Break\u2026 With Your Own Hands**\n\nPull, crush and fling enemies using telekinesis.\n\n**Temp V: Unstable, Unethical, Unforgettable**\n\nHand blades, camouflage, and good old-fashioned laser eyes.\n\n**Explore Key Locations**\n\nThe Seven\u2019s 99th floor. Voughtland. And facilities that don't exist (per Vought legal).\n\n**Brutal Boss Fights**\n\nPathetic Supes. Real blood.\n\n**The Worst Meet-and-Greet Ever**\n\nButcher, M.M., Kimiko, Ashley, Homelander\u2026 and a different kind of Soldier Boy.\n\n**Real Voices**\n\nLaz Alonso, Jensen Ackles, Colby Minifie, and P.J. Byrne are back!\n", "short_description": "Developed with the creators of the hit TV series, The Boys: Trigger Warning hurls you straight into the chaos with the original cast reprising their iconic roles. Step back into the dark world you know and love, with a storyline set within the show\u2019s timeline. Lucas, a loyal Vought employee, was enjoying a lovely day at Voughtland with his daughters when a washed-up group of D-list Supes, the Armstrongs, ruined everything. Now he\u2019s teamed up with The Boys, aiming his rage at Vought.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "ARVORE IMMERSIVE GAMES", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://arvore.io/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sony Pictures Virtual Reality (SPVR)", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://arvore.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "CO